{"4365490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stack & Survive", "steam_appid": 4365490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365490/extras/9db745d9b0b5be38c144ed6a600992a2.poster.avif?t=1779267350\" width=800 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365490/extras/9db745d9b0b5be38c144ed6a600992a2.webm?t=1779267350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365490/extras/9db745d9b0b5be38c144ed6a600992a2.mp4?t=1779267350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Stack to Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Stack &amp; Survive</strong>, every object in the world is a card — resources, tools, enemies, structures, even your survivors.<br>Stack cards together to craft items, trigger events, fight enemies, and uncover powerful combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to play. Deep to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365490/extras/7bcbcb453b144882df3f630948936b8c.poster.avif?t=1779267350\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365490/extras/7bcbcb453b144882df3f630948936b8c.webm?t=1779267350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365490/extras/7bcbcb453b144882df3f630948936b8c.mp4?t=1779267350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🃏 Dynamic Card Stacking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine cards to create tools, cook food, build structures, and unlock hidden recipes.<br>Experiment freely and discover new interactions as you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌅 Day Cycle Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day brings new challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your survivors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the next dawn</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan carefully — every decision matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔ Tactical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast, strategic battles using a rock-paper-scissors inspired combat system.<br>Adapt to enemy types and use smart combinations to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔨 Craft &amp; Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack resources to trigger time-based crafting recipes.<br>Unlock and record new discoveries as you experiment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲 Dynamic Encounters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect the unexpected.<br>Enemies, rare resources, or unexpected allies can appear based on the current day and your progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📜 Quests &amp; Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives, explore new possibilities, and unlock rewards as you grow stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 Emergent Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no single path to survival.<br>Your strategy shapes the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you focus on efficient production?<br>Risk dangerous encounters for rare rewards?<br>Or experiment with strange combinations to uncover hidden power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365490/extras/9db745d9b0b5be38c144ed6a600992a2.poster.avif?t=1779267350\" width=800 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365490/extras/9db745d9b0b5be38c144ed6a600992a2.webm?t=1779267350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365490/extras/9db745d9b0b5be38c144ed6a600992a2.mp4?t=1779267350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Stack to Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Stack &amp; Survive</strong>, every object in the world is a card — resources, tools, enemies, structures, even your survivors.<br>Stack cards together to craft items, trigger events, fight enemies, and uncover powerful combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to play. Deep to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365490/extras/7bcbcb453b144882df3f630948936b8c.poster.avif?t=1779267350\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365490/extras/7bcbcb453b144882df3f630948936b8c.webm?t=1779267350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365490/extras/7bcbcb453b144882df3f630948936b8c.mp4?t=1779267350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🃏 Dynamic Card Stacking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine cards to create tools, cook food, build structures, and unlock hidden recipes.<br>Experiment freely and discover new interactions as you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌅 Day Cycle Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day brings new challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your survivors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the next dawn</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan carefully — every decision matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔ Tactical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast, strategic battles using a rock-paper-scissors inspired combat system.<br>Adapt to enemy types and use smart combinations to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔨 Craft &amp; Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack resources to trigger time-based crafting recipes.<br>Unlock and record new discoveries as you experiment.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎲 Dynamic Encounters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect the unexpected.<br>Enemies, rare resources, or unexpected allies can appear based on the current day and your progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📜 Quests &amp; Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives, explore new possibilities, and unlock rewards as you grow stronger.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 Emergent Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no single path to survival.<br>Your strategy shapes the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you focus on efficient production?<br>Risk dangerous encounters for rare rewards?<br>Or experiment with strange combinations to uncover hidden power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours.</p>", "short_description": "Stack, survive, and discover powerful combinations in a dynamic card-based survival world. Craft, fight, explore, and adapt as every card you place shapes your fate.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365490/3c6ac5fa1c2b1572e5634b573e6984a5db40f0d4/header.jpg?t=1779267350", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4365490/a462a5af2deb881357730094cf44954e34bdd783/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779267350", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as